"\n<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 21s6-5.3 6-10a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 4.7 6 10 6 10z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2.2\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Lektion</div><div class=\"lk-big\">15</div><h1>전치사 2 — 3·4격 지배와 장소 표현</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Wechselpräpositionen und Ortsangaben</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">an·auf·in 같은 아홉 개 전치사는 3격과도 쓰고 4격과도 써요.<br>기준은 하나예요. 머무는 위치(Wo?)면 3격, 움직여 가는 방향(Wohin?)이면 4격이에요 — im Kino(3격) · ins Kino(4격).<br>이 과에서는 이 아홉 전치사, '놓다/놓여 있다' 동사 짝, 그리고 나라·도시·건물·사람에 따라 달라지는 장소 표현을 정리해요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 과에서 익힐 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">3·4격 전치사 아홉 개의 공간 뜻을 알아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">Wo?(위치)면 3격, Wohin?(방향)이면 4격을 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">stellen/stehen · legen/liegen · setzen/sitzen · hängen 짝을 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">가는 곳·있는 곳·온 곳을 장소 종류에 맞는 전치사로 말해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">장소 부사와 방향 부사 hin · her(hinein · heraus …)를 구별해 써요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">복습</span><span class=\"sub-title\">9·13·14과 복습</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Ich fahre mit ____ Bus.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) das</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) den</button></div><div class=\"qe\">mit + 3격, 남성 → dem (14과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Ich gehe ____ Arzt. <span class=\"qh\">병원에</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) zur</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) nach dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) beim</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) zum</button></div><div class=\"qe\">사람·건물로 → zu, zu + dem → zum (14과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Er ist ____ der Chef. <span class=\"qh\">그는 사장이 아니에요</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) kein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) keinen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) nicht</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) keiner</button></div><div class=\"qe\">정관사 명사 → nicht (9과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Gestern ____ ich krank. <span class=\"qh\">sein의 과거형</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) war</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) gewesen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) wäre</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) bin</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sein → war (13과).</div></div></div>\n<section id=\"sec-A\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">A</span><h2>한국어로 먼저 보기</h2></div><p>한국어 '책상 위에'는 머무를 때도, 놓을 때도 같아요 — '책상 위에 있다', '책상 위에 놓다'.<br>'위에'라는 말은 그대로이고 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">동사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">동사</span>동작이나 상태를 나타내는 말이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: lernen 배우다 · sein ~이다</span></span></span>만 달라요.<br>독일어는 같은 auf라도 머무는 위치면 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">3격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">3격</span>주로 '~에게'를 나타내는 자리예요. helfen·danken 같은 동사와 mit·bei·zu 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich gebe dem Kind ein Buch. 아이에게 책을 줘요.</span></span></span>, 그곳으로 옮기는 방향이면 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">4격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">4격</span>주로 '~을/를'을 나타내는 자리예요. 동작을 받는 대상이고, für·ohne 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich sehe den Mann. 그 남자를 봐요.</span></span></span>을 써요.</p><div class=\"dgm\"><div class=\"dgm-cap\">같은 '위에', 다른 격</div><div class=\"dgm-contrast\" style=\"margin:0 0 20px\"><div class=\"dgm-side\"><div class=\"dgm-side-t\">Wo? 어디에 — 3격</div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Das Buch liegt <strong>auf dem</strong> Tisch.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">책이 탁자 위에 놓여 있어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich bin <strong>im</strong> Kino.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">나는 영화관에 있어요.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"dgm-side\"><div class=\"dgm-side-t\">Wohin? 어디로 — 4격</div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich lege das Buch <strong>auf den</strong> Tisch.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">책을 탁자 위에 놓아요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich gehe <strong>ins</strong> Kino.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">나는 영화관에 가요.</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"dgm-note\">한국어는 '~⁠에 있다 / ~⁠에 놓다'로 동사가 구별하고, 독일어는 동사와 함께 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">관사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">관사</span>명사 앞에 붙어 그 명사의 성·수·격과, 정해진 대상인지 아닌지를 나타내는 말이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Hund 그 개 · ein Hund 개 한 마리</span></span></span>의 격까지 바뀌어요.</div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-B\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">B</span><h2>아홉 전치사의 공간 뜻</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">in·an·auf·über·unter·vor·hinter·neben·zwischen은 장소를 나타내는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">전치사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">전치사</span>명사·대명사 앞에 붙어 장소·시간·이유 같은 관계를 나타내는 말이에요. 뒤에 올 격을 정해요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: mit dem Bus · für dich</span></span></span>예요. 이 아홉 개는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">3격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">3격</span>주로 '~에게'를 나타내는 자리예요. helfen·danken 같은 동사와 mit·bei·zu 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich gebe dem Kind ein Buch. 아이에게 책을 줘요.</span></span></span>도, <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">4격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">4격</span>주로 '~을/를'을 나타내는 자리예요. 동작을 받는 대상이고, für·ohne 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich sehe den Mann. 그 남자를 봐요.</span></span></span>도 써요.</p></div></div><figure class=\"fig\"><div class=\"fig-scroll\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 392\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"아홉 전치사가 나타내는 위치\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><marker id=\"nine_preps-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mki\"/></marker><marker id=\"nine_preps-acc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mka\"/></marker><marker id=\"nine_preps-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mko\"/></marker><marker id=\"nine_preps-no\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkn\"/></marker><marker id=\"nine_preps-w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkw\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"10.0\" width=\"185.0\" height=\"117.0\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-box\"/><rect x=\"58.0\" y=\"62.0\" width=\"94.0\" height=\"9.0\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-boxs\"/><line x1=\"68.0\" y1=\"71.0\" x2=\"68.0\" y2=\"102.0\" class=\"f-leg\"/><line x1=\"142.0\" y1=\"71.0\" x2=\"142.0\" y2=\"102.0\" class=\"f-leg\"/><circle cx=\"105.0\" cy=\"51.0\" r=\"11.0\" class=\"f-fa\"/><text x=\"102.0\" y=\"122.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">auf</text><rect x=\"205.0\" y=\"10.0\" width=\"185.0\" height=\"117.0\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-box\"/><rect x=\"253.0\" y=\"62.0\" width=\"94.0\" height=\"9.0\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-boxs\"/><line x1=\"263.0\" y1=\"71.0\" x2=\"263.0\" y2=\"102.0\" class=\"f-leg\"/><line x1=\"337.0\" y1=\"71.0\" x2=\"337.0\" y2=\"102.0\" class=\"f-leg\"/><circle cx=\"300.0\" cy=\"29.0\" r=\"11.0\" class=\"f-fa\"/><text x=\"297.0\" y=\"122.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">über</text><rect x=\"400.0\" y=\"10.0\" width=\"185.0\" height=\"117.0\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-box\"/><rect x=\"448.0\" y=\"62.0\" width=\"94.0\" height=\"9.0\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-boxs\"/><line x1=\"458.0\" y1=\"71.0\" x2=\"458.0\" y2=\"102.0\" class=\"f-leg\"/><line x1=\"532.0\" y1=\"71.0\" x2=\"532.0\" y2=\"102.0\" class=\"f-leg\"/><circle cx=\"495.0\" cy=\"91.0\" r=\"11.0\" class=\"f-fa\"/><text x=\"492.0\" y=\"122.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">unter</text><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"135.0\" width=\"185.0\" height=\"117.0\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-box\"/><rect x=\"72.0\" y=\"173.0\" width=\"66.0\" height=\"54.0\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-boxs\"/><circle cx=\"105.0\" cy=\"203.0\" r=\"11.0\" class=\"f-fa\"/><text x=\"102.0\" y=\"247.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">in</text><rect x=\"205.0\" y=\"135.0\" width=\"185.0\" height=\"117.0\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-box\"/><rect x=\"267.0\" y=\"173.0\" width=\"66.0\" height=\"54.0\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-boxs\"/><circle cx=\"256.0\" cy=\"201.0\" r=\"11.0\" class=\"f-fa\"/><text x=\"297.0\" y=\"247.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">an</text><rect x=\"400.0\" y=\"135.0\" width=\"185.0\" height=\"117.0\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-box\"/><rect x=\"462.0\" y=\"173.0\" width=\"66.0\" height=\"54.0\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-boxs\"/><circle cx=\"550.0\" cy=\"216.0\" r=\"11.0\" class=\"f-fa\"/><text x=\"492.0\" y=\"247.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">neben</text><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"260.0\" width=\"185.0\" height=\"117.0\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-box\"/><rect x=\"70.0\" y=\"306.0\" width=\"64.0\" height=\"46.0\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-boxs\"/><path d=\"M70,306 L86,292 L150,292 L134,306 Z\" class=\"f-boxs2\"/><path d=\"M134,306 L150,292 L150,338 L134,352 Z\" class=\"f-boxs2\"/><circle cx=\"100.0\" cy=\"337.0\" r=\"12.0\" class=\"f-fa\"/><text x=\"102.0\" y=\"372.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">vor</text><rect x=\"205.0\" y=\"260.0\" width=\"185.0\" height=\"117.0\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-box\"/><circle cx=\"317.0\" cy=\"285.0\" r=\"11.0\" class=\"f-fa\"/><rect x=\"265.0\" y=\"306.0\" width=\"64.0\" height=\"46.0\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-boxs\"/><path d=\"M265,306 L281,292 L345,292 L329,306 Z\" class=\"f-boxs2\"/><path d=\"M329,306 L345,292 L345,338 L329,352 Z\" class=\"f-boxs2\"/><text x=\"297.0\" y=\"372.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">hinter</text><rect x=\"400.0\" y=\"260.0\" width=\"185.0\" height=\"117.0\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-box\"/><rect x=\"432.0\" y=\"304.0\" width=\"46.0\" height=\"48.0\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-boxs\"/><rect x=\"512.0\" y=\"304.0\" width=\"46.0\" height=\"48.0\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-boxs\"/><circle cx=\"495.0\" cy=\"341.0\" r=\"11.0\" class=\"f-fa\"/><text x=\"492.0\" y=\"372.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">zwischen</text></svg></div><figcaption>아홉 전치사가 나타내는 위치</figcaption></figure><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>전치사</th><th>뜻</th><th>Wo? 3격</th><th>Wohin? 4격</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>an</td><td>~⁠에 붙어서 · 옆면·가장자리</td><td>an <strong>der</strong> Wand 벽에</td><td>an <strong>die</strong> Wand 벽에(걸어)</td></tr><tr><td>auf</td><td>~ 위에 (닿아서)</td><td>auf <strong>dem</strong> Tisch</td><td>auf <strong>den</strong> Tisch</td></tr><tr><td>hinter</td><td>~ 뒤에</td><td>hinter <strong>dem</strong> Haus</td><td>hinter <strong>das</strong> Haus</td></tr><tr><td>in</td><td>~ 안에</td><td>in <strong>der</strong> Küche</td><td>in <strong>die</strong> Küche</td></tr><tr><td>neben</td><td>~ 옆에</td><td>neben <strong>dem</strong> Bett</td><td>neben <strong>das</strong> Bett</td></tr><tr><td>über</td><td>~ 위에 (떨어져서) · ~⁠을 건너</td><td>über <strong>dem</strong> Sofa</td><td>über <strong>das</strong> Sofa</td></tr><tr><td>unter</td><td>~ 아래에</td><td>unter <strong>dem</strong> Stuhl</td><td>unter <strong>den</strong> Stuhl</td></tr><tr><td>vor</td><td>~ 앞에</td><td>vor <strong>der</strong> Tür</td><td>vor <strong>die</strong> Tür</td></tr><tr><td>zwischen</td><td>~ 사이에</td><td>zwischen <strong>den</strong> Stühlen</td><td>zwischen <strong>die</strong> Stühle</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-key\"><span class=\"co-badge \">an · auf · über</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">an은 옆면이나 가장자리에 붙은 위치 — das Bild <strong>an</strong> der Wand 벽의 그림 · <strong>am</strong> Fenster 창가에<br>auf는 위에 닿아 있는 위치 — die Tasse <strong>auf</strong> dem Tisch 탁자 위의 컵<br>über는 위에 떨어져 있는 위치 — die Lampe <strong>über</strong> dem Tisch 탁자 위에 달린 등</p></div></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" alt=\"Die Lampe hängt über dem Tisch. Die Vase steht auf dem Tisch. Der Hund liegt unter dem Tisch. Die Pflanze steht neben dem Tisch. Das Bild hängt an der Wand. 등은 탁자 위에 달려 있고, 꽃병은 탁자 위에 놓여 있어요. 개는 탁자 밑에 누워 있고, 화분은 탁자 옆에 있어요. 그림은 벽에 걸려 있어요.\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><div><span class=\"ph-de\">Die Lampe hängt <strong>über dem</strong> Tisch. Die Vase steht <strong>auf dem</strong> Tisch.</span><span class=\"ph-de\">Der Hund liegt <strong>unter dem</strong> Tisch. Die Pflanze steht <strong>neben dem</strong> Tisch.</span><span class=\"ph-de\">Das Bild hängt <strong>an der</strong> Wand.</span><span class=\"ph-ko\">등은 탁자 위에 달려 있고, 꽃병은 탁자 위에 놓여 있어요. 개는 탁자 밑에 누워 있고, 화분은 탁자 옆에 있어요. 그림은 벽에 걸려 있어요.</span></div></figcaption></figure><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">축약형</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">an dem → am · in dem → im (3격) / an das → ans · in das → ins (4격)<br>말할 때는 aufs(auf das)·übers(über das)도 써요.</p></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-C\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">C</span><h2>Wo? 3격 · Wohin? 4격</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">어디에 있으면 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">3격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">3격</span>주로 '~에게'를 나타내는 자리예요. helfen·danken 같은 동사와 mit·bei·zu 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich gebe dem Kind ein Buch. 아이에게 책을 줘요.</span></span></span>, 어디로 가면 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">4격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">4격</span>주로 '~을/를'을 나타내는 자리예요. 동작을 받는 대상이고, für·ohne 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich sehe den Mann. 그 남자를 봐요.</span></span></span>이에요 — Ich bin <strong>im</strong> Kino. 극장에 있어요. / Ich gehe <strong>ins</strong> Kino. 극장에 가요.</p></div></div><figure class=\"fig\"><div class=\"fig-scroll\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 232\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Wo?는 머무는 자리로 3격, Wohin?은 가는 방향으로 4격\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><marker id=\"wo_wohin-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mki\"/></marker><marker id=\"wo_wohin-acc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mka\"/></marker><marker id=\"wo_wohin-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mko\"/></marker><marker id=\"wo_wohin-no\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkn\"/></marker><marker id=\"wo_wohin-w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkw\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M90,63 L150,18 L210,63 V136 H90 Z\" class=\"f-boxs\"/><circle cx=\"150.0\" cy=\"104.0\" r=\"11.0\" class=\"f-fa\"/><line x1=\"300.0\" y1=\"14.0\" x2=\"300.0\" y2=\"222.0\" class=\"f-ln\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"/><path d=\"M410,63 L470,18 L530,63 V136 H410 Z\" class=\"f-boxs\"/><circle cx=\"338.0\" cy=\"104.0\" r=\"11.0\" class=\"f-fa\"/><line x1=\"352.0\" y1=\"104.0\" x2=\"452.0\" y2=\"104.0\" class=\"f-lo\" marker-end=\"url(#wo_wohin-ok)\"/><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"166.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\">Wo?</tspan> → 3격</text><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"192.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\">Die Katze ist <tspan font-weight=\"700\">im</tspan> Haus.</text><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"216.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\">고양이가 집 안에 있어요.</text><text x=\"450.0\" y=\"166.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-okt\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\">Wohin?</tspan> → 4격</text><text x=\"450.0\" y=\"192.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\">Die Katze läuft <tspan font-weight=\"700\">ins</tspan> Haus.</text><text x=\"450.0\" y=\"216.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\">고양이가 집 안으로 들어가요.</text></svg></div><figcaption>머물러 있으면 3격, 그곳으로 움직이면 4격</figcaption></figure><div class=\"dgm\"><div class=\"dgm-cap\">동사가 무엇을 말하는지 보고 격을 골라요</div><div class=\"flow\"><div class=\"flow-node\">동사가 '어디로 옮겨 가는 움직임'인가?<div class=\"flow-sub\">gehen, fahren, legen, stellen, hängen …</div></div><div>↓</div><div class=\"flow-node\">그렇다면 Wohin? → 4격<div class=\"flow-sub\">Ich gehe <strong>in den</strong> Park.</div></div><div>↓</div><div class=\"flow-node\" style=\"background:var(--accent-bg);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);font-weight:600\">머무르거나 그 안에서 일어나는 일이면 Wo? → 3격<div class=\"flow-sub\">Ich bin <strong>im</strong> Park. · Ich laufe <strong>im</strong> Park.</div></div></div></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" alt=\"Die Katze liegt auf dem Sofa. 고양이가 소파 위에 누워 있어요. (Wo? → 3격) / Die Katze springt auf das Sofa. 고양이가 소파 위로 뛰어올라요. (Wohin? → 4격)\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"ph-pair\"><div><span class=\"ph-de\">Die Katze <strong>liegt auf dem</strong> Sofa.</span><span class=\"ph-ko\">고양이가 소파 위에 누워 있어요. (Wo? → 3격)</span></div><div><span class=\"ph-de\">Die Katze <strong>springt auf das</strong> Sofa.</span><span class=\"ph-ko\">고양이가 소파 위로 뛰어올라요. (Wohin? → 4격)</span></div></figcaption></figure><div class=\"callout callout-warn\"><span class=\"co-badge co-warn\">움직여도 3격인 경우</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">그 장소 안에서만 움직이면 위치(Wo?)라서 3격이에요.<br>Ich laufe <strong>im</strong> Park. 공원에서 뛰어요(공원 안에서). · Ich laufe <strong>in den</strong> Park. 공원으로 뛰어 들어가요.<br>Wir tanzen <strong>auf der</strong> Straße. 길에서 춤춰요. · Das Kind läuft <strong>auf die</strong> Straße. 아이가 길로 뛰어나가요.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">Wo? · Wohin?</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Ich gehe heute in ____ Supermarkt.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) das</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) dem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">가는 방향 → 4격, 남성 → den.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Ich arbeite in ____ Bäckerei.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) eine</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) einen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) einem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) einer</button></div><div class=\"qe\">일하는 곳(위치) → 3격, 여성 → einer.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Die Katze schläft unter ____ Bett.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) das</button></div><div class=\"qe\">위치 → 3격, 중성 → dem.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Die Katze springt auf ____ Sofa. <span class=\"qh\">소파 위로 뛰어올라요</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) das</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) der</button></div><div class=\"qe\">방향 → 4격, 중성 → das.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Das Bild hängt an ____ Wand.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) die</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) der</button></div><div class=\"qe\">위치 → 3격, 여성 → der.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Wir fahren am Wochenende in ____ Berge. <span class=\"qh\">산으로</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) die</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) den</button></div><div class=\"qe\">방향 → 4격 복수 → die.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Die Kinder spielen ____ Garten. <span class=\"qh\">정원에서</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) im</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) ins</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) am</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) in den</button></div><div class=\"qe\">그 안에서 노는 것 → 위치, in + dem → im.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Das Auto steht zwischen ____ Häusern.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) die</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) den</button></div><div class=\"qe\">위치 → 3격 복수 → den + 명사 -n.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-D\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">D</span><h2>놓다 · 놓여 있다 — 위치 동사의 짝</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">'놓다'(stellen·legen·setzen·hängen) 뒤의 장소는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">4격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">4격</span>주로 '~을/를'을 나타내는 자리예요. 동작을 받는 대상이고, für·ohne 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich sehe den Mann. 그 남자를 봐요.</span></span></span>, '놓여 있다'(stehen·liegen·sitzen·hängen) 뒤의 장소는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">3격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">3격</span>주로 '~에게'를 나타내는 자리예요. helfen·danken 같은 동사와 mit·bei·zu 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich gebe dem Kind ein Buch. 아이에게 책을 줘요.</span></span></span>이에요 — Ich lege das Buch auf <strong>den</strong> Tisch. / Das Buch liegt auf <strong>dem</strong> Tisch.</p></div></div><p>'놓다'와 '놓여 있다'는 서로 다른 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">동사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">동사</span>동작이나 상태를 나타내는 말이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: lernen 배우다 · sein ~이다</span></span></span>예요. 옮기는 동사는 4격 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">목적어<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">목적어</span>동사의 동작을 받는 말이에요. 독일어에서는 주로 4격이나 3격이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich sehe den Film. → den Film</span></span></span>와 Wohin?, 놓여 있는 동사는 목적어 없이 Wo?와 써요.</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-first\"><thead><tr><th>옮기다 (Wohin? + 4격)</th><th>놓여 있다 (Wo? + 3격)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>stellen</strong> 세워 놓다</td><td><strong>stehen</strong> 서 있다</td></tr><tr><td><strong>legen</strong> 눕혀 놓다</td><td><strong>liegen</strong> 누워 있다 · 놓여 있다</td></tr><tr><td><strong>setzen</strong> 앉히다 · sich setzen 앉다</td><td><strong>sitzen</strong> 앉아 있다</td></tr><tr><td><strong>hängen</strong> 걸다</td><td><strong>hängen</strong> 걸려 있다</td></tr><tr><td><strong>stecken</strong> 꽂다 · 넣다</td><td><strong>stecken</strong> 꽂혀 있다 · 들어 있다</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich <strong>stelle</strong> die Flasche <strong>auf den</strong> Tisch. → Die Flasche <strong>steht auf dem</strong> Tisch.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">병을 탁자에 세워 놓아요. → 병이 탁자 위에 서 있어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich <strong>lege</strong> das Handy <strong>auf den</strong> Tisch. → Das Handy <strong>liegt auf dem</strong> Tisch.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">휴대폰을 탁자에 놓아요. → 휴대폰이 탁자 위에 있어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich <strong>hänge</strong> das Bild <strong>an die</strong> Wand. → Das Bild <strong>hängt an der</strong> Wand.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">그림을 벽에 걸어요. → 그림이 벽에 걸려 있어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich <strong>setze</strong> mich <strong>auf den</strong> Stuhl. → Ich <strong>sitze auf dem</strong> Stuhl.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">의자에 앉아요. → 의자에 앉아 있어요.</span></div></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" alt=\"Ich lege das Buch auf den Tisch. 책을 탁자 위에 놓아요. (Wohin? → 4격) / Das Buch liegt auf dem Tisch. 책이 탁자 위에 놓여 있어요. (Wo? → 3격)\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"ph-pair\"><div><span class=\"ph-de\">Ich <strong>lege</strong> das Buch <strong>auf den</strong> Tisch.</span><span class=\"ph-ko\">책을 탁자 위에 놓아요. (Wohin? → 4격)</span></div><div><span class=\"ph-de\">Das Buch <strong>liegt auf dem</strong> Tisch.</span><span class=\"ph-ko\">책이 탁자 위에 놓여 있어요. (Wo? → 3격)</span></div></figcaption></figure><div class=\"callout callout-key\"><span class=\"co-badge \">stellen이냐 legen이냐</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">세워 두는 물건(병·컵·꽂아 둔 책·의자)은 stellen/stehen, 눕혀 두는 물건(종이·휴대폰·쌓아 둔 책·옷)은 legen/liegen이에요.<br>한국어는 둘 다 '놓다·있다'로 말해서 헷갈리기 쉬워요.</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">과거분사가 달라요</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">옮기는 동사는 규칙 동사, 놓여 있는 동사는 불규칙 동사예요 — gestellt / gestanden · gelegt / gelegen · gesetzt / gesessen · gehängt / gehangen (12과).</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">위치 동사</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Ich ____ das Glas in den Schrank. <span class=\"qh\">유리잔을 찬장에 넣어요(세워서)</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) stehe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) stelle</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) lege</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) liege</button></div><div class=\"qe\">옮기는 동사 + 4격, 세워 두는 물건 → stellen.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Der Schlüssel ____ auf dem Tisch. <span class=\"qh\">열쇠가 탁자 위에 있어요</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) liegt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) legt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) steht</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) stellt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">놓여 있음 + 3격, 눕혀 있는 물건 → liegen.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Wohin hast du die Jacke gehängt? — An ____ Haken.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) die</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) dem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">hängen(걸다) → Wohin? → 4격, der Haken → den.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Das Kind ____ auf dem Sofa. <span class=\"qh\">아이가 소파에 앉아 있어요</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) setzen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) setzt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) sitzt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) sitzen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">앉아 있음 → sitzen + 3격.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Leg das Buch bitte auf ____ Regal! <span class=\"qh\">책을 선반에 올려 줘</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) das</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) der</button></div><div class=\"qe\">legen → Wohin? → 4격, das Regal → das.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-E\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">E</span><h2>장소 표현 정리 — 가는 곳 · 있는 곳 · 온 곳</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">가는 곳·있는 곳·온 곳은 장소의 종류에 따라 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">전치사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">전치사</span>명사·대명사 앞에 붙어 장소·시간·이유 같은 관계를 나타내는 말이에요. 뒤에 올 격을 정해요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: mit dem Bus · für dich</span></span></span>가 달라요. 도시는 nach·in·aus, 사람은 zu·bei·von을 써요.</p></div></div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>장소</th><th>Wohin? 가는 곳</th><th>Wo? 있는 곳</th><th>Woher? 온 곳</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>도시 · 관사 없는 나라</td><td><strong>nach</strong> Berlin · nach Korea</td><td><strong>in</strong> Berlin · in Korea</td><td><strong>aus</strong> Berlin · aus Korea</td></tr><tr><td>관사 있는 나라</td><td><strong>in die</strong> Schweiz · in die USA</td><td><strong>in der</strong> Schweiz · in den USA</td><td><strong>aus der</strong> Schweiz · aus den USA</td></tr><tr><td>건물 · 방 (안으로)</td><td><strong>in die</strong> Schule · <strong>ins</strong> Kino</td><td><strong>in der</strong> Schule · <strong>im</strong> Kino</td><td><strong>aus der</strong> Schule · <strong>aus dem</strong> Kino</td></tr><tr><td>사람</td><td><strong>zu</strong> Anna · <strong>zum</strong> Arzt</td><td><strong>bei</strong> Anna · <strong>beim</strong> Arzt</td><td><strong>von</strong> Anna · <strong>vom</strong> Arzt</td></tr><tr><td>바다 · 호수 · 강</td><td><strong>ans</strong> Meer · <strong>an den</strong> See</td><td><strong>am</strong> Meer · <strong>am</strong> See</td><td><strong>vom</strong> Meer · <strong>vom</strong> See</td></tr><tr><td>섬 · 광장 · 시장 · 행사</td><td><strong>auf</strong> eine Insel · <strong>auf den</strong> Markt</td><td><strong>auf der</strong> Insel · <strong>auf dem</strong> Markt</td><td><strong>von der</strong> Insel · <strong>vom</strong> Markt</td></tr><tr><td>산</td><td><strong>in die</strong> Berge</td><td><strong>in den</strong> Bergen</td><td><strong>aus den</strong> Bergen</td></tr><tr><td>집</td><td><strong>nach</strong> Hause</td><td><strong>zu</strong> Hause</td><td><strong>von</strong> zu Hause</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">건물에는 zu도 써요</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">목적지로서의 건물에는 zu도 써요 — <strong>zum</strong> Bahnhof · <strong>zur</strong> Post · <strong>zum</strong> Supermarkt.<br>그 안으로 들<span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">어간<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">어간</span>동사원형에서 끝의 -en(-n)을 뗀 부분이에요. 여기에 인칭어미를 붙여요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: lernen → lern-</span></span></span>다는 느낌이면 in + <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">4격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">4격</span>주로 '~을/를'을 나타내는 자리예요. 동작을 받는 대상이고, für·ohne 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich sehe den Mann. 그 남자를 봐요.</span></span></span>이에요 — <strong>in den</strong> Supermarkt.</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-warn\"><span class=\"co-badge co-warn\">관사가 있는 나라</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">die Schweiz · die Türkei · der Iran · die USA · die Niederlande처럼 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">관사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">관사</span>명사 앞에 붙어 그 명사의 성·수·격과, 정해진 대상인지 아닌지를 나타내는 말이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Hund 그 개 · ein Hund 개 한 마리</span></span></span>가 있는 나라는 nach가 아니라 in + 4격으로 가요.<br>Ich fliege <strong>in die</strong> USA. · Er wohnt <strong>in der</strong> Türkei.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">장소 표현</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Wir fahren im Urlaub ____ Italien.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) in</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) in die</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) zu</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) nach</button></div><div class=\"qe\">관사 없는 나라로 → nach.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Sie wohnt ____ Schweiz.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) bei der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) in der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) in die</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) nach der</button></div><div class=\"qe\">관사 있는 나라, 위치 → in der.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Ich war gestern ____ meiner Freundin. <span class=\"qh\">여자 친구 집에 있었어</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) bei</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) zu</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) in</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) an</button></div><div class=\"qe\">사람이 있는 곳 → bei.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Am Wochenende fahren wir ____ Meer.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) zum</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) am</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ins</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) ans</button></div><div class=\"qe\">바다로 → an + 4격 → ans.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Ich gehe ____ Markt. <span class=\"qh\">시장에</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) auf den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) zum den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) in den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) am</button></div><div class=\"qe\">시장·광장 → auf + 4격.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Er kommt gerade ____ Arzt. <span class=\"qh\">병원에서 오는 길이에요</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) beim</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) vom</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) aus dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) von den</button></div><div class=\"qe\">사람에게서 → von, von + dem → vom.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Wir wandern gern ____ Bergen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) in die</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) in den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) an den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) auf den</button></div><div class=\"qe\">산에서(위치) → in den Bergen.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-F\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">F</span><h2>장소 부사와 방향 부사 — hin · her</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">전치사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">전치사</span>명사·대명사 앞에 붙어 장소·시간·이유 같은 관계를 나타내는 말이에요. 뒤에 올 격을 정해요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: mit dem Bus · für dich</span></span></span> 없이 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">부사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">부사</span>동사·형용사·문장 전체를 꾸미는 말이에요. 형태가 변하지 않아요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: heute · gern · sehr · oft</span></span></span> 하나로 장소(oben·draußen)와 방향(hin·her)을 말할 수 있어요 — Komm <strong>herein</strong>! 들어와!</p></div></div><figure class=\"fig\"><div class=\"fig-scroll\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 186\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"hin은 말하는 사람에게서 멀어지는 쪽, her는 말하는 사람에게 오는 쪽\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><marker id=\"hin_her-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mki\"/></marker><marker id=\"hin_her-acc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mka\"/></marker><marker id=\"hin_her-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mko\"/></marker><marker id=\"hin_her-no\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkn\"/></marker><marker id=\"hin_her-w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkw\"/></marker></defs><circle cx=\"300.0\" cy=\"65.6\" r=\"12.1\" class=\"f-fa\"/><rect x=\"284.6\" y=\"82.1\" width=\"30.8\" height=\"37.4\" rx=\"13.200000000000001\" class=\"f-fa\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"146.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\">나 (말하는 사람)</text><line x1=\"270.0\" y1=\"84.0\" x2=\"62.0\" y2=\"84.0\" class=\"f-la\" marker-end=\"url(#hin_her-acc)\"/><text x=\"166.0\" y=\"64.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\">hin</tspan> — 나에게서 멀어지는 쪽</text><text x=\"166.0\" y=\"110.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\">Geh <tspan font-weight=\"700\">hin</tspan>! · Geh <tspan font-weight=\"700\">hinein</tspan>!</text><line x1=\"540.0\" y1=\"84.0\" x2=\"332.0\" y2=\"84.0\" class=\"f-lo\" marker-end=\"url(#hin_her-ok)\"/><text x=\"436.0\" y=\"64.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-okt\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\">her</tspan> — 나에게 오는 쪽</text><text x=\"436.0\" y=\"110.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\">Komm <tspan font-weight=\"700\">her</tspan>! · Komm <tspan font-weight=\"700\">herein</tspan>!</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"176.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\">hinein 안으로 (들어가) · herein 안으로 (들어와)</text></svg></div><figcaption>hin과 her — 말하는 사람을 기준으로 한 방향</figcaption></figure><p>질문의 Wo?·Wohin?·Woher? 구별은 전치사와 같아요.</p><h3>장소 부사 — Wo?</h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>부사</th><th>뜻</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>hier · da · dort</td><td>여기 · 거기 · 저기</td><td>Ich warte <strong>hier</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td>oben · unten</td><td>위에 · 아래에</td><td>Das Bad ist <strong>oben</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td>drinnen · draußen</td><td>안에 · 밖에</td><td>Die Kinder spielen <strong>draußen</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td>vorne · hinten</td><td>앞에 · 뒤에</td><td>Wir sitzen <strong>hinten</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td>links · rechts</td><td>왼쪽에 · 오른쪽에</td><td>Die Bank ist <strong>links</strong>.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>hin과 her — 누구 쪽으로 움직이나요</h3><p>hin은 말하는 사람에게서 멀어지는 쪽, her는 말하는 사람 쪽으로 오는 쪽이에요.</p><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Komm <strong>her</strong>!</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">나에게로</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">이리 와!</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Geh <strong>hin</strong>!</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">나에게서 멀어짐</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">거기로 가!</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Wo gehst du <strong>hin</strong>? / Wo kommst du <strong>her</strong>?</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">말할 때는 wohin · woher를 둘로 나눠요</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">어디 가? / 어디서 와?</span></div></div><h3>방향을 더하면 — hinein · heraus …</h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-first\"><thead><tr><th>방향</th><th>멀어지는 쪽 (hin-)</th><th>다가오는 쪽 (her-)</th><th>말할 때</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>안으로</td><td>hinein</td><td>herein</td><td>rein</td></tr><tr><td>밖으로</td><td>hinaus</td><td>heraus</td><td>raus</td></tr><tr><td>위로</td><td>hinauf</td><td>herauf</td><td>rauf</td></tr><tr><td>아래로</td><td>hinunter</td><td>herunter</td><td>runter</td></tr><tr><td>건너편으로</td><td>hinüber</td><td>herüber</td><td>rüber</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Komm <strong>herein</strong>!</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">말하는 사람이 안에 있어요</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">들어와!</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Er geht <strong>hinaus</strong>.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">말하는 사람에게서 멀어져요</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">그는 나가요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Kommst du <strong>runter</strong>?</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">말할 때는 짧게 — hin · her 구별이 없어져요</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">내려올래?</span></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">분리동사처럼 움직여요</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">hinein · heraus 같은 말은 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">동사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">동사</span>동작이나 상태를 나타내는 말이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: lernen 배우다 · sein ~이다</span></span></span>와 붙어 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">분리동사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">분리동사</span>앞부분(접두어)이 문장 끝으로 떨어져 나가는 동사예요. 접두어에 강세가 있어요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: aufstehen → Ich stehe um 7 Uhr auf.</span></span></span>가 돼요(11과) — Ich <strong>gehe</strong> jetzt <strong>hinaus</strong>. · Er ist <strong>hereingekommen</strong>.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">장소 부사와 방향 부사</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> (문 안에서 손님에게) Kommen Sie bitte ____! <span class=\"qh\">들어오세요</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) heraus</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) hinein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) herein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) hinaus</button></div><div class=\"qe\">말하는 사람이 안 → 다가옴 → herein.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Wo ist das Badezimmer? — ____, im ersten Stock. <span class=\"qh\">위층에요</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Oben</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Hinauf</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Herauf</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Nach oben</button></div><div class=\"qe\">위치(Wo?) → oben.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> (친구에게) Wo gehst du ____? <span class=\"qh\">어디 가?</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) her</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) hinein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) hin</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) dort</button></div><div class=\"qe\">멀어지는 방향 → hin.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Bei schönem Wetter spielen die Kinder ____. <span class=\"qh\">밖에서</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) heraus</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) raus</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) hinaus</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) draußen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">위치(Wo?) → draußen.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-G\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">G</span><h2>가장 많이 하는 실수</h2></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 1</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">방향에 3격을 써요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Ich gehe in dem Kino.<span class=\"tx-n\">위치</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Ich gehe ins Kino.<span class=\"tx-n\">영화관에 가요</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">가는 곳(Wohin?)은 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">4격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">4격</span>주로 '~을/를'을 나타내는 자리예요. 동작을 받는 대상이고, für·ohne 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich sehe den Mann. 그 남자를 봐요.</span></span></span>이에요 — in das → ins.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 2</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">위치에 4격을 써요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Ich bin in den Park.<span class=\"tx-n\">방향</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Ich bin im Park.<span class=\"tx-n\">공원에 있어요</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">있는 곳(Wo?)은 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">3격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">3격</span>주로 '~에게'를 나타내는 자리예요. helfen·danken 같은 동사와 mit·bei·zu 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich gebe dem Kind ein Buch. 아이에게 책을 줘요.</span></span></span>이에요.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 3</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">옮기는 동사와 놓여 있는 동사를 바꿔 써요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Ich stehe die Flasche auf den Tisch.<span class=\"tx-n\">'서 있다'</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Ich stelle die Flasche auf den Tisch.<span class=\"tx-n\">병을 세워 놓아요</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\"><span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">목적어<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">목적어</span>동사의 동작을 받는 말이에요. 독일어에서는 주로 4격이나 3격이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich sehe den Film. → den Film</span></span></span>가 있으면 stellen·legen·setzen·hängen(걸다), 없으면 stehen·liegen·sitzen·hängen(걸려 있다)이에요.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 4</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">관사 있는 나라에 nach를 써요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Ich fahre nach der Schweiz.<span class=\"tx-n\">nach + 관사</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Ich fahre in die Schweiz.<span class=\"tx-n\">스위스에 가요</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\"><span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">관사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">관사</span>명사 앞에 붙어 그 명사의 성·수·격과, 정해진 대상인지 아닌지를 나타내는 말이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Hund 그 개 · ein Hund 개 한 마리</span></span></span> 있는 나라는 in + 4격이에요.</div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">실수 피하기</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> '나는 부엌에 가요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich gehe nach der Küche.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Ich gehe in die Küche.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich gehe in der Küche.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich gehe zu Küche.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">방(안으로) 가는 방향 → in + 4격.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> '그 컵은 탁자 위에 있어요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Die Tasse liegt auf den Tisch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Die Tasse stellt auf dem Tisch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Die Tasse steht auf dem Tisch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Die Tasse steht auf den Tisch.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">컵은 세워져 있으니 stehen이에요. 움직임 없는 위치(Wo?)라서 auf dem Tisch는 3격이에요.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> '나는 내일 미국에 가요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich fliege morgen nach USA.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich fliege morgen in den USA.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich fliege morgen nach den USA.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Ich fliege morgen in die USA.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">관사 있는 복수 나라 → in die USA.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> '나는 의자에 앉아요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Ich setze mich auf den Stuhl.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich setze mich auf dem Stuhl.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich sitze auf den Stuhl.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich sitze mich auf den Stuhl.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">앉는 동작 → sich setzen + 4격.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-H\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">H</span><h2>참고</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">시간을 나타내는 an · in · vor</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">an·in·vor가 시간을 나타낼 때는 늘 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">3격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">3격</span>주로 '~에게'를 나타내는 자리예요. helfen·danken 같은 동사와 mit·bei·zu 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich gebe dem Kind ein Buch. 아이에게 책을 줘요.</span></span></span>이에요 — <strong>am</strong> Montag · <strong>im</strong> Mai · <strong>vor einer</strong> Woche(7과).</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">über + 4격 — ~⁠에 대해</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">über가 '~⁠에 대해'라는 뜻이면 늘 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">4격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">4격</span>주로 '~을/를'을 나타내는 자리예요. 동작을 받는 대상이고, für·ohne 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich sehe den Mann. 그 남자를 봐요.</span></span></span>이에요 — Wir sprechen <strong>über den</strong> Film. 그 영화에 대해 이야기해요(18과).</p></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-I\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">I</span><h2>바로 쓰는 문장 · 일상 회화</h2></div><p>위치와 방향을 말하는 문장이에요.</p><div class=\"exl talk-l\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Das Handy <strong>liegt auf dem</strong> Tisch.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">다스 핸디 리크트 아우프 뎀 티쉬</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">휴대폰은 탁자 위에 있어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich gehe heute Abend <strong>ins</strong> Kino.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">이히 게에 호이테 아벤트 인스 키노</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">오늘 저녁에 영화 보러 가요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Wir fahren im Sommer <strong>ans</strong> Meer.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">비어 파렌 임 좀머 안스 메어</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">여름에 바다로 가요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Häng</strong> die Jacke bitte <strong>an den</strong> Haken!</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">행 디 야케 비테 안 덴 하켄</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">재킷은 옷걸이에 걸어 줘!</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich bin gerade <strong>bei</strong> meiner Oma.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">이히 빈 게라데 바이 마이너 오마</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">지금 할머니 댁에 있어요.</span></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"summary\"><div class=\"summary-card\"><h2 class=\"sum-title\">이 과 정리</h2><div><div class=\"sum-li\">3·4격 전치사 아홉 — an · auf · hinter · in · neben · über · unter · vor · zwischen</div><div class=\"sum-li\">머무는 위치(Wo?)는 3격, 옮겨 가는 방향(Wohin?)은 4격 — im Kino · ins Kino</div><div class=\"sum-li\">장소 안에서만 움직이면 3격 — Ich laufe im Park.</div><div class=\"sum-li\">옮기다 + 4격: stellen · legen · setzen · hängen / 놓여 있다 + 3격: stehen · liegen · sitzen · hängen</div><div class=\"sum-li\">도시·관사 없는 나라: nach / in / aus, 관사 있는 나라: in die / in der / aus der</div><div class=\"sum-li\">사람: zu / bei / von, 바다·호수: ans / am / vom, 섬·광장: auf / auf / von, 집: nach Hause / zu Hause</div><div class=\"sum-li\">장소 부사 oben · unten · drinnen · draußen(Wo?) / hin은 멀어지는 쪽, her는 다가오는 쪽 — Komm herein! · Geh hinaus!</div></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">다음 ⏭ 16과</span><div>16과에서는 '~⁠의'를 나타내는 2격과 2격 전치사(wegen·trotz·während·statt), 그리고 der Student → den Studenten처럼 끝이 바뀌는 n-변화 명사를 배워요.</div></div></section><section id=\"solutions\" class=\"solutions\"><h2 class=\"sol-title\">Lösungen — 정답 모아보기</h2><div class=\"sol-grid\"><div><b>9·13·14과 복습</b>1. dem · 2. zum · 3. nicht · 4. war</div><div><b>Wo? · Wohin?</b>1. den · 2. einer · 3. dem · 4. das · 5. der · 6. die · 7. im · 8. den</div><div><b>위치 동사</b>1. stelle · 2. liegt · 3. den · 4. sitzt · 5. das</div><div><b>장소 표현</b>1. nach · 2. in der · 3. bei · 4. ans · 5. auf den · 6. vom · 7. in den</div><div><b>장소 부사와 방향 부사</b>1. herein · 2. Oben · 3. hin · 4. draußen</div><div><b>실수 피하기</b>1. Ich gehe in die Küche. · 2. Die Tasse steht auf dem Tisch. · 3. Ich fliege morgen in die USA. · 4. Ich setze mich auf den Stuhl.</div></div></section>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>\n"